  "FAQ_ITEMS": [
    {
      "q": "How does the single institution application fee policy work?",
      "a": "Under the Gabstep Application Portal system, your application fee is charged per institution, not per individual program. You can select up to two distinct courses at your chosen university for the same single institutional fee."
    },
    {
      "q": "What happens if I choose an institution with CAD 0.00 / Free application fee?",
      "a": "Partner institutions marked as Fee-Free have negotiated application fee waivers with Gabstep. In Step 5, the payment gateway is automatically bypassed, and your application is submitted directly at zero cost."
    },
    {
      "q": "When will I receive my portal access credentials?",
      "a": "Immediately upon successful completion and submission of Step 5. The system provisions your applicant account and displays your login key while instantly launching your live dashboard."
    },
    {
      "q": "What is the Europass CV requirement for European institutions?",
      "a": "German and European partner institutions strictly prefer the standardized Europass CV format. When selecting Germany as your study destination, Step 4 will provide direct guidelines and formatting recommendations."
    },
    {
      "q": "Can I edit my application details after submission?",
      "a": "Yes! Your Applicant Dashboard includes a dedicated Self-Service Corrections portal. You can modify your phone number, residential address, previous GPA, or re-upload clearer documents before final institutional review. Institution and course selections are locked post-payment."
    }
  ]
